{"strongs": "H5475", "word": "סוֺד", "translit": "sod", "root": "סוד", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "council, counsel", "definition": "סוֺד noun [masculine] council, counsel ; — ׳ ס absolute Prov 11:13 +; construct Jer 6:11 +; suffix סוֺדִי Jer 23:22 ; Job 19:19 סוֺדוֺ Amos 3:7 ; Prov 3:32 סֹדָם Gen 49:6 — 1. council , in familiar conversation; — \\ \\ a. divan or circle of familiar friends, בַּחוּרִים ׳ ס Jer 6:11 , משׂחקים ׳ מ Jer 15:17 ׳ מְתֵי סוֺדִ Job 19:19 men of my intimate circle ; ׅ ׳ עמד בסוד (י Jer 23:18 ; Jer 23:22 in the intimate circle of ׳ י ; בסוד אלוה Job 15:8 in bad sense, מְרֵעִים ׳ ס Ps 64:3 . \\ \\ b. assembly, company , יְשָׁרִים ׳ ס Ps 111:1 (|| עֵדָה ; סוֺד עמי Ezek 13:9 קדשׁים ׳ ס Ps 89:8 (of angels); in bad sense, בסוד בא Gen 49:6 (|| קהל ). 2. counsel , taken by those in familiar conversation: \\ \\ a. counsel itself, מחשׁבות באין סוד Prov 15:22 thoughts without counsel ; of intimate friendship, Ps 55:15 נַמְתִּיק סוֺד ; in bad sense, of crafty plotting Ps 83:4 יַעֲרִימוּ סוֺד \\ \\ b. secret counsel , which may be revealed ( גלה ), Amos 3:7 ; Prov 11:13 ; Prov 20:19 ; Prov 25:9 . \\ \\ c. familiar converse with God, intimacy , ׳ י ׳ ליראיו ס Ps 25:14 intimacy with ׳ י have those who fear him (|| ברית ), אתיֿשׁרים סודוֺ Prov 3:22 with the upright is his intimacy ; here also Job 29:4 (si vera lectio) Di De and others; Siegf Du compare Buhl Lex בְּסֹךְ when Eloah sheltered my tent.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5519')\">BDB5519</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5475')\">H5475</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5518')\">BDB5518</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5520')\">BDB5520</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>סוֺד</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>council, counsel</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ס</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Prov 11:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,13)\">Pro